  "request": "Goal: Make review/gate continue to acceptance-review when AI retry limits are reached instead of stopping. Scope: review/gate/test-review retry exhaustion paths, flow-findings.json recording, acceptance-review delegation, removal of regex-based mechanical classification over AI finding prose, deterministic prechecks for coverage/header/tooling/schema/command failures, and prompt/test updates. Out of Scope: unrelated flow behavior changes and project-specific logic. Description: Issue #386 reports remaining paths where REVIEW_MAX_ATTEMPTS_EXCEEDED or GATE_MAX_ATTEMPTS_EXCEEDED returns control to the user. Unresolved AI semantic findings should be recorded and deferred to acceptance-review, while tooling/schema/command/mechanical failures should be classified before AI retry budget consumption.",
